cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  LimbalMicroarrayAnalysis: reproducible pipeline for comparative systems-level
  transcriptomics of the human limbal epithelium
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying
  article.
type: software
authors:
