      Laboratorio de Investigación Interdisciplinaria, Escuela Nacional de
      Estudios Superiores Unidad León, UNAM, León, Mexico
  - given-names: Federico
    family-names: Castro-Muñozledo
    affiliation: >-
      Departamento de Biología Celular, Centro de Investigación y de Estudios
      Avanzados del IPN, México City, Mexico
repository-code: 'https://github.com/kap8416/LimbalMicroarrayAnalysis'
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for the comparative systems-level transcriptomic analysis
  of human limbal epithelial identity. Two public ocular-surface microarray
  datasets (GSE38190, GSE56421) are harmonized into a single gene-level matrix and
  interrogated through three limbus-anchored contrasts and five analytical layers:
  differential expression, functional over-representation, protein-protein
  interaction topology, master regulator inference, and condition-specific
  co-expression rewiring.
keywords:
  - transcriptomics
  - limbal epithelium
  - corneal epithelium
  - gene regulatory networks
  - master regulator analysis
  - protein-protein interaction networks
  - extracellular matrix
  - stem cell niche
  - reproducible research
  - microarray meta-analysis
license: MIT
